Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD feature-done confirmation so clean reviews close
 patch chats explicitly

Clean review results produce a patch-chat yes/no decision so reviewed work can be closed for navigation while any no response or later typing reopens the same chat for additional patch-agent work.
