+reviewed patch chat. A `yes` or `y` response records the user reply, appends
+`work-leaf: feature closed`, and closes that chat for terminal navigation. A `no`, `n`, or any other
+follow-up text appends `work-leaf: feature reopened` and keeps the chat active so more patch-agent
+work can continue. Repeated clean reviews append numbered confirmation prompts so every review pass
+has a visible completion decision.
